  "about": "Reviewed in docs/how-to/play-console-answers.md \u00a711.1. Realm data is end-to-end encrypted and not declared (Google's E2EE exemption). No SDK telemetry: MediaPipe and Play Billing log through datatransport, whose upload backend Control's manifest strips (\u00a711.0). Device ID = Tenshu's own per-device id on the relay, only with sync. The deletion URL is the public account-deletion page (web/apex /account/delete, \u00a713 D2).",
